INY264X2=\s\s輸入：|Y| < 2^64, |X| < 2^64, X <> 0   輸出：[-PI..PI] 弧度 }
;\s\sIN: |Y| < 2^64, |X| < 2^64, X <> 0   OUT: [-PI..PI] radians }
