OptionToCalculateOnlyAPart=只計算影像的一部分以加快預覽的選項。\n計算前請先用滑鼠在影像中選取範圍。
;Option to calculate only a part of the image for a faster preview.\nMake a selection in the image with the mouse before calculating.
OptionToDitherTheAngleOf=針對 1:2 或 1:3 的影像縮放，對光線角度進行抖動的選項。\n這可提高精確度並減少斑點狀瑕疵。\n注意：只能用於相同的影像縮放比例，否則會出現抖動瑕疵。
;Option to dither the angle of rays for an image scaling of 1:2 or 1:3.\nThis leads to more precision and less spotty artifacts.\nCaution: use only on the same image scaling, else you get dither artifacts.
