StopsWalkingAtThisDistanceTo=在與物件相距此距離時停止行走。\n設為 0 可停用。
;Stops walking at this distance to the object.\nSet to 0 to disable.
StoreAnAdditionalCorrespondingPNGFile=另外儲存一個對應的 *.PNG 檔，方便預覽影像
;Store an additional corresponding *.PNG-file for simpler preview of the image
