ThisComputer=這台電腦：
;This computer:
ThisEffectIsAccumulatedOnEach=每次按下按鈕都會累積此效果，可按「重設」按鈕\n重設——但反射也會一併被復原！
;This effect is accumulated on each button press, you can reset by pressing\nthe 'Reset' button - but reflections would also be undone!
ThisFileAlreadyExistsDoYou=此檔案已存在。確定要覆寫嗎？
